{
 "_comment": "Extract of S3 r2.7 (JSON twin 1d2c4b2f..., pinned in mvp/wave1-pins-20261106-S3r27): the records operations and the schemas they use. Made by script (nemo, scratch/nemo/s3-extract.py, which reproduces the r2.6 extract byte for byte); edit nothing here.",
